# Reference checksum file for the Riptide CLI handoff template.
#
# Downstream adopters commit this file at
# `scripts/ci/riptide-engine.sha256` (drop the `.example` suffix) and
# fill in the SHA256 + filename for the `riptide-engine-<target-triple>`
# asset of whatever Riptide release they pin under `RIPTIDE_CLI_SPEC`.
#
# Regenerate with (Linux x86_64 example):
#
#   curl -fsSL -o riptide-engine-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu \
#     https://github.com/riptidesim/riptide/releases/download/v<VERSION>/riptide-engine-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu
#   sha256sum riptide-engine-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu > scripts/ci/riptide-engine.sha256
#
# Pin both the checksum AND the Riptide version (`RIPTIDE_ENGINE_VERSION`
# in the template) in the same commit so bumps are diff-reviewable.

TODO_SHA256_64_HEX_CHARS_HERE  riptide-engine-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu
